Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.83,0:00:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   你能帮我挑个订婚戒指给摩妮卡吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, can you help me pick an engagement ring for Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没法决定   好难挑啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't figure this out. It's so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要选第凡内切割法的  还是公主方切割法的还是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Should I get her a Tiffany cut, or a princess cut or a--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢噢   被纸切割法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow! Paper out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟其他人说了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, have you told anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我没告诉其他人  我不想让摩妮卡发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I don't want to tell anybody else because I don't want Monica to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可你告诉我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我信任你   你是我最好的朋友之一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's because I trust you, and we're best friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我正在看戒指广告的时候   你进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you walked in on me while I was looking at ring brochures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次我不敲门进来的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah well, once again, not knocking pays off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望你不要刚好在蹲马桶就好了  我希望也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I only wish you hadn't been on the toilet. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  要不要去喝咖啡  好啊  走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Chandler, wanna go to the coffeehouse? Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  我们正想找你们一块去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, perfect. We were just gonna see if you wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了  我们去另外一家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, we don't, because we got the other place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真没礼貌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你想咬一口吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry. You want a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第23集  订婚戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E23  The One With The Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和保罗交往得怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how are things going with Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过   他不太爱说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although, you know, he's a private guy. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真想让他稍微敞开点心胸   好分享他的感受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I wish I could get him to open up a bit. Share some feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太容易了   把他当成一罐打不开的泡菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's easy. You just have to think of him as a jar of pickles that won't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该把他泡进热水里   然后把他的头往桌子上撞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should run him under hot water and bang his head against a table?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  那是严刑逼供\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's what you do when you want to get the truth out of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗   看我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you? Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  保罗  嘿   菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Paul. Hi, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how are things going with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.59,0:02:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  罗斯  我也很高兴见到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great to-Ross, good to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好   拜  保重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Bye. You take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   你们在搞什么鬼   钱德还放我们鸽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs, what was the deal with you and Chandler blowing us off before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很奇怪  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, that was so weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   为什么要这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我   是钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't do it. It was Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他  他在生你的气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's-He's mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   为什么  拜托   你明知故问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why? Oh, please. I think you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想不起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你是古生物学家  再往下挖深一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Ross. You're a paleontologist. Dig a little deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   是不是因为两个星期前   乔伊和我没找他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, is it because Joey and I didn't invite him to that Knicks game...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去看纽约尼克斯队的球赛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a couple weeks ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他会为这种事生气吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you think that's something that he'd be mad at you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该会  那好  我也是这么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess it could. Well, then I think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他生气了  他为什么不说呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if he's angry, he really shouldn't just cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他能告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish he'd just tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你应该抓着他的头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, if that's what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泡进热水里  再把他的头往桌子上撞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then you really should run him under hot water and bang his head against the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的   我在中国花园订了位   你好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, I made a reservation at China Garden. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以啊   太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先等等   给我说说说   你今天好不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But first, wait, talk to me, talk to me. Tell me about your day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蛮好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   你在想什么  你此刻在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what are you thinking? What are you thinking right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想你穿这条裙子真漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm thinking that you are looking really fine in that dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  保罗  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's great, Paul. But, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道  哇  好结实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to know what-Wow, those are really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just want to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这坚强平静的外表下面到底隐藏着什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...what is behind this strong, silent exterior?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俗语说静水深流\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, they say that still waters run deep...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想在你的心中畅游\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I want to swim in yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you talking about having sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  保罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, PauL
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不了解你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如你的童年   跟我聊聊你小时候的事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, like your childhood. Tell me about your childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很普通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那青春期呢  如何  那是一段痛苦的时光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, then how about puberty? Come on. That's always a painful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友请你参加聚会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, your friends invite you to a slumber party...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.47,0:04:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁你睡着   把你的手放进热水里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and stick your hand in warm water...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你尿在睡袋里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...while you're sleeping so that you pee in your sleeping bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没碰过那种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that never happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你走运   没碰上那个贱人莎朗麦杰斯基\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you're lucky you never met that bitch, Sharon Majeski.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有后悔过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The rest of your life, you know. Any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   保罗  我要求得不多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Paul. I'm not asking for a lot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就告诉我点什么   随便什么都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Just give me something. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay. okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我6岁那年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was 6 years old... Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要一辆大脚踏车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I wanted a Big Wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父母却送我一只  塑料小鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And instead, my parents got me this little...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骑着到处跳的那种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...plastic chicken that you hop around on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太难为情了  小朋友都取笑我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was embarrassing. Kids made fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那一年  真够难过的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was a pretty tough year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. See? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我更了解你了   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I already feel like I know you a little better. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们去吃饭吧   走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, come on. Now we can go eat. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都叫我 "小鸡孩"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They called me "Chicken Boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五年级我跟别人打架   其实也不算真打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fifth grade, I got in a fight. Well, it wasn't really a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查达伦一拳打在我鼻子上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard Danville bit me on the nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我摔倒了  这里留了个小伤疤  你看嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I fell down, still have a little scar right here. You can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  我看见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. I see the scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:06:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  你听我说  你能分享这些感受真是太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, Paul, I think this is really great that, you know, you've shared your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's really... It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你刚才说我们去吃什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, urn, what do you say we go share some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在吃不下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I couldn't eat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么啊   你最爱吃宫保鸡丁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? You love their Kung Pao chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸡弟弟  天哪  对不起  我不是故意的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chicken Boy! I'm sorry. I didn't mean to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逛了几百家首饰店   一无所获\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this is the nine millionth ring store we've been to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.05,0:06:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是找不到完美的戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I can't find the perfect ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难看  难看  难看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugly ring, ugly ring, ugly ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮  精品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a beautiful selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不然   你不要送戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so maybe you don't get her a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送点不一样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you do something different, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,例如订婚手镯   或是订婚皇冠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you get her an engagement bracelet. Or an engagement tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者  一把订婚独立战争毛瑟枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh! An engagement Revolutionary War musket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴选你来帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I'm so glad I picked you to help me with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想像一下你单膝跪地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't you imagine getting down on one knee...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向她献上这把漂亮的武器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and handing her this gorgeous piece of weaponry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看   还是送戒指好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm gonna stick with the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只好漂亮   我喜欢这只\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this one's nice. I like it this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生  大哥  我可以看这枚戒指吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sir? Kind sir, can I see this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   你找我来就是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. This is the reason you brought me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会砍价  所以接下来交给我处理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know how to haggle. So let me handle this from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么需要吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  我想看那枚戒指   要么什么都不看  随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I would like to see that ring, please. Or not. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一只20年代的戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This ring is from the 1920s.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面有1点5克拉钻石   两侧各镶有蓝宝石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a one-and-a-half karat diamond with sapphires on either side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生  你能不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sir, could I ask you to, um...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿出这只戒指向我求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could you hold out that ring and ask me to marry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊   好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  就是它了  就选这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, that's it. That's the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多少钱   钱德   让我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much is it? Chandler, I will handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多少钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8千6百元块美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eight thousand six hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出10块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We will give you $10.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想不想买啊  想  想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you interested in this ring? Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我只能出8千块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I can only pay $8000.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  8千可以  我们坚持只付10块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I can let it go for 8. We stand firm at $10.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您用什么付帐   刷信用卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How would you like to pay? Uh, credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   糟了  我的卡在乔伊那边了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. No, no, but I lent my credit card to Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我回去拿   你守住戒指  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll go get it. You guard the ring. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的事很抱歉啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'm sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这里有10块钱的东西吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have anything here for $10?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有啊   我有两张崭新的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yes. I have these two rather beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5元钞票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...five-dollar bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出1块钱跟你买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll give you $1 for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  记得钱德和菲比昨天把我们甩了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, remember how Chandler and Phoebe blew us off yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗  你当时在吃披萨   对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember, you were eating pizza? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显  钱德在生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, apparently Chandler's angry at us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就为我们两星期前   没帮他买纽约尼克斯队的球票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for not getting him a ticket to that Knicks game a couple weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:08:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要帮他买票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, we were supposed to just get him a ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙老是揩我们的油   就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That guy is always mooching off of us. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不管怎么样   我想我们该做点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I still think we should try to patch things up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以给他搞张尼克斯队比赛的票和他一起去看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like, maybe we could get him tickets to another Knicks game and invite him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意   而且他的信用卡也在我这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, that's a great idea. And I still have his credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您的帐单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿  我有卡  拿去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey. I got this one. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说  有时候我真搞不懂钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I gotta tell you, sometimes I just don't get Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直背着你出去玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, me and him do stuff all the time without you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不会生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you don't get all upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直   一直\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All the time? All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪   我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在哭   跟小女生一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still crying? Like a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道   我知道都是我不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know, I know. This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我要他敞开心胸的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanted him to open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不知道我会放出一头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But God, I didn't know that I was gonna unleash...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哭哭啼啼又黏人的怪物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...this weepy, clingy, moist monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道有两种方法可以让男人闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I only know of two sure-fire ways to shut a man up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一种是性爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And one of them is sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外一个是呢   不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the other? I Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来不需要用到另一种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never had to use the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说  如果作爱就没时间讲话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just saying, you know, if we're having sex, he's not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  话多的是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, that's right. You're the talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说  是个好主意  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, uh, great idea. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去趟商店   我答应去帮他买纸巾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I gotta go to the store. I told him that I would buy him some more tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里有  不  你们没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, we have some here. No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我还想试试这顶王冠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um, I'd also like to try on the tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎么样   太花了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, what do you think? Too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A tad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  把皇冠放回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then take the tiara back...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再让我试试那把枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and let me hold the musket again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少了点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   把我朋友挑的戒指拿给我看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see the ring that my friend picked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那枚20年代的钻戒呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's the 1920s princess-cut ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚卖给那位先生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just sold it to that gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完蛋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   别走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放我出去   快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me out! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  你好吗   还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you, Paul? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸抱过你吗   没有  他抱过你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...did your dad ever hug you? No. Did he hug you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲从来没拥抱过我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that my dad never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想念我爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I miss my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以去赌城   看我爸亲别人的爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you can see my dad in Vegas kissing other dads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   钱德   怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you...?
