Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在有点忙  保罗  我爸以前都这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a little busy here, Paul. That's exactly what my dad used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  就一下下  来吧  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. A quick one. Come on, hug it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再多5秒钟   够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Five more seconds-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  什么   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! What? Hey, what--?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   保罗  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Paul, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿了我的信用卡  是  在我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have my credit card? Yeah. It's in my...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的口袋里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后面的口袋  后袋  幸好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My back pocket. Back pocket. Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我买了今晚尼克斯队的票  我不能去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I got tickets to the Knicks tonight. I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去啦   会很好玩的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:13:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  你  罗斯  也许还有保罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me, you, Ross and... Paul, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   我找到了最完美的戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, I found the perfect ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不错   但我还是想买之前挑重的那款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's pretty nice, but I'm gonna go with the one I picked first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  钱德  你挑的那只戒指不在了  没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wake up, Chandler. The one you picked is gone. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  被人买走了  我想拦住他  却被他们关进监狱里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Some guy bought it. I'm sorry. I tried to stop him but they put me in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你关进监狱里   就是两道门之间的小监狱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They put you in jail? The little jail between the doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我要你看着那只戒指  我知道  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, I asked you to guard the ring. I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  这只更漂亮   摩妮卡莫不会看到其他戒指的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, you know, this ring is better. And Monica never even saw the other ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是他用那只戒指向我求婚时  我起了鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. But when he proposed to me with the ring, I got goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为那个男人  是因为那枚戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe it was the guy. It was the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  他听到票的事兴奋吗  不  他回绝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so was he excited about the tickets? No. He blew us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在真的有点生他的气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a little mad at him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他生气不告诉我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? He didn't want to talk to us about being angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧  我们也什么都不要告诉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe we don't talk to him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他打入冷宫   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Freeze him out. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢  给他好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like it. Ah? We'll show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从今以后  就是乔伊与罗斯  最佳拍档\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From now on, it's gonna be Joey and Ross, best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将是新的乔伊与钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, we're gonna be the new Joey and Chandler. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把想说的话都写下来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! I have so much more to tell you. I've written it all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, actually, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了  真的好棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. That's really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  写字  写东西  会燃起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I gotta tell you, writing, all that writing, it gets me, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,燃起我的欲火\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It gets me kind of hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你听这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait. Listen to this:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我小时候想当什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Know what I wanted to be when I was that age?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情圣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冲浪运动员   是吗  冲浪运动员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A surfer. Oh, yeah. A surfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想与海浪为伍  停一停\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanted to be one with the waves-Honey, hold on real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  让我坐得更舒服一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on a second. Let me just get a little more comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, now wait a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这样是不是太暴露了  不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't too revealing, is it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当年那个小家伙呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever happened to that little dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,充满了梦想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So full of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎那个什么小家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care about the little dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法   我听不下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't. I cannot listen to any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有心理医师才想听这些话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, the only person who'd listen to this is a mental health professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们听这个每1小时赚1百元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's only because they get paid $100 an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我听到现在可以赚多少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know how much money I could've made listening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2000块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我什么时候算出来的   就在你说话的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know when I figured that out? While you were talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然想让我闷死吗  14个小时前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you're trying to stifle me, when just 14 hours ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚谈到我妈就是想这么对我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we figured out that that's exactly what my mother was trying to do to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意的  我不是想把你闷死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't mean... I didn't mean to stifle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是没办法控制自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is all just a little overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是故意的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't mean to overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过情绪一发泄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that when those gates open...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就容易一发不可收拾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's hard to close them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过现在没事了  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But they are closed now. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴  你跟我分享这些事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so glad. I'm so glad you shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也很高兴你说完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm glad that you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what do you say we, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我求之不得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd really like that. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   我居然听了你的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. I can't believe you talked me into...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,买了这只造型怪异的廉价戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...buying this stupid gumball-machine-looking ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它才不廉价呢   看它多漂亮啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a stupid gumball-machine-looking ring. It's a beautiful ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不漂亮呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外一枚戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I looked at the other ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能看见拿给摩妮卡时的表情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I could see Monica's face when I gave it to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还能看到她点头答应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I could see her saying yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这只戒指   怎么看它都是一只戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I look at this ring, all I see is a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有近看  才能看到我的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless I look at it really closely, and then I can see my own eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我这辈子要做的最重要的一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, this is the most important thing I'm gonna do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望做的完美无缺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to make sure it's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   那我们或许还有办法把那只戒指要回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. There may be a way that we could get the other ring back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偷听到那人告诉珠宝店  他准备求婚的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I heard the guy tell the jeweler where he was gonna propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以说服他交换或怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So maybe we could get him to trade rings or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总不能给她那只廉价的戒指吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you certainly can't give her that stupid gumball ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好  他还没求婚   那个女的没有戴戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, and he hasn't proposed yet. She has no ring on her finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真行   下次我们应该一起来破案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you're good. After this, we should solve crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.71,0:18:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  去请他过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Okay. Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉   先生  请您过来一下  有您的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, sir. Could you come with me, please? You have a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁   是你的办公室打来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is it? It is your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道是谁吗  约翰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know who at my office? John.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰啊  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, John. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了   你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There he is. Hi. Hi. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样  珠宝店搞错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, there was a mix-up at the jewelry store.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算用来求婚的戒指是我预订的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The ring you're about to propose with was supposed to be held for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想把它换回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm gonna need to have that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过作为交换   我愿意拿这只更漂亮更值钱的戒指和你交换\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But in exchange, I'm willing to trade you this beautiful, more expensive ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  要是我就换了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I would trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确很漂亮   但是我就想用这只求婚  失陪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is beautiful, but I'm gonna use this one. Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:19:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  这位是我的未婚妻   她就是要这枚戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. See, this is my fiancée, and her heart was set on that ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想伤她的心吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't want to break her heart now, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊   你想伤一位垂死女人的心吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Do you want to break a dying woman's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她快死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, she's dying...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显  她快咳死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...of a cough, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这是我临死前的愿望  如果我不能戴着这只戒指安息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's my dying wish to have that ring. See, if I'm not buried with that ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会变成孤魂野鬼游荡在阴间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then my spirit will wander the netherworld--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  够了  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, that's enough, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看戒指   当然  看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see the ring. Great. Okay, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.34,0:19:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  谢谢  谢谢  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll do it. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会嫁给一个很棒的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you are about to marry a wonderful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   我要娶一个快死的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I'm marrying a dead woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:19:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有大事要宣布\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got something important to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟摩妮卡求婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna ask Monica to marry me.
